{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14020","headline":"送蜀客还 · 耿湋","name":"送蜀客还","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万峯深积翠，路向此中难。\n欲暮多羇思，因高莫远看。\n卓家人寂寞，扬子业荒残。\n唯见岷山水，悠悠带月寒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14020.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14020","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}